  "prefLabel": "Sw 503.05 Confidentiality",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 503.05 Confidentiality. Any records resulting from an assignment under this section shall be exempt from disclosure providing such records are of the types specified in RSA 91-A:5. Upon written request, the commission shall release the name, town or residence, date of prize, and the gross and net amounts of the annual prize payment of a winner. Financing statements filed with the commission shall be public records.\n\nSource. #7094, eff 9-15-99; ss by #8898, eff 9-15-07; ss by #10987, eff 12-3-15; ss by #10987, eff 12-3-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw500.html"
